{"severity":"error","file":"errors/linear_module_let_1.march","start_line":10,"start_col":2,"end_line":10,"end_col":30,"message":"`shared` has the linear type `RingBuf(a)`, so it cannot be a module-level `let`: a module-level value is shared by every function and every actor, and a linear value must be consumed exactly once.\nCreate it where it is used, or keep it in an actor's state.","code":"linear_module_let","fix":null,"labels":[],"notes":[]}
